        "product_summary": "Widened forefoot design: This specific style is described by the source as a wide-last shoe, with the actual rounded toe shown in close-up.\n\nKnitted upper and textile lining: Fine knit texture covers the forefoot, while the entry and interior are shown in original photographs.\n\nSlip-on collar: A notched opening and rear pull loop form the closed-heel entry without a lace fastening.\n\nEVA outsole pattern: A slim side band runs around the shoe and the actual underside shows repeated textured sections.\n\nThree colour options: Black, Dark Grey and Navy are listed in EU39-46 for wholesale assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
